      "note": "Adopts the hand-named fixture; the file has no generated header.",
      "source": [
        "'' FVARS holds -$1000_0000..$0FFF_FFFF; one past the positive end is an error.",
        "'' (The legal values on both sides are in DAT-PASM-tests/fvar_fvars_encoding.spin2.)",
        "DAT",
        "                org",
        "                byte    FVARS $0FFF_FFFF",
        "                byte    FVARS $1000_0000"
      ]
    }
  ]
